        "faq_T9z4xy": {
          "type": "faq",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "Holiday Puchases",
            "answer": "<p>Valentine's Day Purchases</p><p>Week of January 25, 2026: The effects of Winter Storm have extended order processing and shipping estimates. We recommend placing your order as soon as possible for any time-sensitive purchases. You may see your order’s status at any time using the <a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/order-tracker/\">Track Your Order</a> page.<br/><br/><strong>Valentine’s Day Shipping:</strong> To ensure Valentine's Day delivery prior to February 14 we recommend placing your order before 12:00 p.m. EST on Thursday, February 12 with express delivery.<br/><br/>If you need assistance with personalization options, details on extended store hours, or guidance for the perfect present, please visit our <a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/contact-us.html\">Contact Us</a> page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_NTG9rd": {
          "type": "faq",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "Will my items be gift wrapped?",
            "answer": "<p>All Tiffany.com purchases arrive in the signature Tiffany Blue Box, tied with a white satin ribbon. At the checkout process you will have the option of writing a gift message for each item in your order which will arrive with your gift package, enclosed in a white envelope. If you choose not to write a gift message, one blank card per recipient will be included in your order.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Related FAQs:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-shipping-options-are-available-online/what-shipping-options-are-available-online.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">What shipping options are available on Tiffany.com?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">How can I make returns or exchanges?</span></a></li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "faq_QNafiQ": {
          "type": "faq",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "Can I ship my order to an international location?",
            "answer": "<p>No, currently we are only able to accept online orders to shipping addresses within the United States.</p><p>Tiffany & Co. also offers e-commerce services to Canada, Japan and Australia. In Europe, we offer e-commerce services to the UK, Austria, Belgium, France, Germany, Ireland, Italy, the Netherlands and Spain. To find your country’s website, please visit <a href=\"https://www.international.tiffany.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Tiffany.com/International</span></a>.</p><p>To inquire about shipments to U.S. territories, APO or FPO addresses, please contact Client Care at <strong>800 843 3269</strong>.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-accordion-clp/customer-services/customer-service.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">View Client Care Hours</span></a></p><p><strong>Related FAQs</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-shipping-options-are-available-online/what-shipping-options-are-available-online.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">What shipping options are available on Tiffany.com?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">How can I make returns or exchanges?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/how-do-i-track-my-online-order/how-do-i-track-my-online-order.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Can I track my online order?</span></a></li></ul>"
          }
        },
