        "faq_jX3i4x": {
          "type": "faq",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "Are Tiffany & Co. products insured when shipped?",
            "answer": "<p>Tiffany & Co. is responsible for orders until the package is delivered to the customer. If the package goes missing, Tiffany & Co. may choose to open an investigation with the carrier to determine the responsible party. Please <a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/contact-us.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Contact Us</span></a> if your order details indicate the package has been delivered but nothing was received.</p><p><strong>Related FAQs</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-shipping-options-are-available-online/what-shipping-options-are-available-online.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">What shipping options are available on Tiffany.com?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy/what-is-the-tiffany-return-exchange-policy.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">How can I make returns or exchanges?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/how-do-i-track-my-online-order/how-do-i-track-my-online-order.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Can I track my online order?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/will-my-items-be-gift-wrapped/will-my-items-be-gift-wrapped.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Will my Tiffany.com purchase arrive gift-wrapped?</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq-folder/shipping-returns-faq/can-i-ship-my-order-to-an-international-location/can-i-ship-my-order-to-an-international-location.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Can I ship my order to an international location?</span></a></li></ul>"
          }
