        "faq_KbxQxY": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "What shipping options are available on Tiffany.com?",
            "answer": "<p>For each address within the United States, the following charges apply:</p><p> </p><p><strong>Standard Shipping: $0</strong></p><p>Available on all orders under $1,000. Please allow 3-5 business days to receive your items. Items ordered together may not always ship together.</p><p>Tiffany & Co. is proud to support the UPS® carbon neutral program on 100% of U.S. ground shipments. <a href=\"https://press.tiffany.com/tiffany-co-becomes-the-first-luxury-jeweler-to-receive-sbti-approval-on-net-zero-emissions-target/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Click here</span></a> to learn more about Tiffany & Co.’s 2040 net-zero target.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Express Shipping: $15 (complimentary for orders above $1,000)</strong></p><p>Available on all orders, however, orders above $1,000 require a signature upon delivery. Please allow 1-2 business days to receive your items. Items ordered together may not always ship together.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Next-day delivery: $25 (complimentary for orders above $3,000)</strong></p><ul><li>Orders placed before 3:00PM EST Monday through Friday will be delivered on the following day.</li><li>Orders placed on Saturday before 1:00PM EST will be delivered Monday.</li><li>Sunday and holiday delivery are not available. Next-day delivery is not offered for watches or personalized items.</li></ul><p>Please note that all orders above $1,000 require a signature.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Buy Online, Pick Up in Store: USD $0</strong></p><p>In-store pickup is currently available at all Tiffany & Co. stores in the United States, with the exception of Hawaii locations. <a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq/store-information-faq/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Learn more</span></a>.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Engraving Schedule</strong></p><p>Please allow an additional 1-2 days for delivery of standard engraved items and additional 3-4 days for delivery of monogrammed and hand-engraved items.</p><p>Currently, we are only able to accept online orders to shipping addresses within the United States and do not ship internationally. To ensure the secure delivery of your order, Tiffany & Co. does not ship orders to post office boxes. Tiffany & Co. is able to accept post office box addresses for your billing needs.</p><p>To inquire about shipments within the U.S. APO or FPO addresses, please get in touch with our Client Contact Center at 800 843 3269.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/contact-us.html\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">View Customer Service Hours</span></a></p><p> </p><p><strong>More Information on Complimentary Shipping:</strong></p><ul><li>Sales tax & engraving fees do not count toward the total amount.</li><li>Complimentary shipping is only available for orders placed on the U.S. Website for domestic delivery.</li><li>In-store pickup is available at select store locations. <a href=\"https://www.tiffany.com/faq/store-information-faq/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Learn more</span></a>.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Wb7CkP": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category_key": "shipping",
            "question": "How do I track my online order?",
            "answer": "<p>A shipping notification with tracking details will be sent via email after your order has shipped. You will receive multiple email acknowledgements if your order results in more than one shipment.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>How can I change or cancel my order?</strong></span></p><p>Please note that we cannot guarantee that your order may be adjusted once it has been submitted.</p>"
          }
        }
